    {
      "id": "an-jinquan-mingzong-appointment",
      "title": "明宗即位后任振武节度使",
      "summary": "与李嗣源有旧交，明宗即位后授同平章事、振武军节度使。",
      "year": 926,
      "sortOrder": 1,
      "precision": "month",
      "sourceDate": "明宗即位；明宗纪天成元年五月壬戌任振武",
      "phase": "later",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "chapterId": "new-v25",
          "paragraphId": "new-v25-p47",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "de857bdb7ab1d63f5952945f94455baa65357e8b7345d2e22d3789b197a791b1",
          "excerpt": "金全與明宗有舊，明宗即位，拜金全振武軍節度使、同中書門下平章事。"
        },
        {
          "chapterId": "old-v036",
          "paragraphId": "old-v036-p2",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "c657cbf1a74e96c14c58230cf4836ce20ba5e74b94126c8ccef01a645c7ff6a9",
          "excerpt": "五月丙辰朔，帝不視朝，臨於西宮。"
        },
        {
          "chapterId": "old-v036",
          "paragraphId": "old-v036-p3",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "465386c52a2bd3b1e3453fba8ce770ab84d2444e6a1c507692a771659b2b2bcd",
          "excerpt": "壬戌，以前相州刺史、北京左右廂都指揮使安金全為安北都護、振武節度使、同平章事。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
